</div>
<div id="lstnumberx33" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5</span>
              
              
              
            <span id="lstnumberx33.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">    </span><span id="lstnumberx33.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">expires_at</span><span id="lstnumberx33.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">?:</span><span id="lstnumberx33.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx33.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">string</span><span id="lstnumberx33.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">;</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx34" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6</span>
              
              
              
            <span id="lstnumberx34.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">}</span>
</div>
</div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float">Listing 4: </span>Resource metadata response</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="S4.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">The <span id="S4.SS1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">total_count</span> field may differ from the original preview response if the underlying data source has changed, enabling clients to detect stale references. The status field allows graceful handling of expired or processing resources before attempting data retrieval. Servers may update <span id="S4.SS1.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">expires_at</span> timestamps on access to extend lifetimes for frequently-used queries.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.2 </span>Data Retrieval</h3>

<div id="S4.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Full dataset access occurs through HTTP POST requests with pagination and sorting parameters:</p>
</div>
