<div id="S6.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Following OAuth 2.0’s .well-known pattern <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib7" title="" class="ltx_ref">7</a>]</cite>, servers may expose complete operational metadata at /.well-known/resource-link-service found at the baseUrl defined in the MCP initialization exchange.</p>
</div>
